      "en": "Therefore my spirit is overwhelmed within me. My heart within me is desolate.",
      "ko": "그러므로 내 심령이 속에서 상하며 내 마음이 속에서 참담하니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "2534a480afe7d29408b545f8f315e78418b10c317dab92cfff94a731116c01e2",
      "translation_text_hash": "7cc3d2c85bd57537e9c45594fc38b01a5975cb0803ea72aa9f166d871c7d4f69",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
